  "cdse:browser_search_path": "CLMS Bio-geophysical Parameters, Evapotranspiration",
  "cdse:collection_description": "Actual evapotranspiration is provided together with its two components — soil evaporation and canopy transpiration — and accompanying quality indicators. The estimates are derived from two evapotranspiration schemes and an ensemble of models. Dekadal (10-day) estimates are available globally in near real time, at a spatial resolution of approximately 300 m, from November 2025 onwards.",
